\ The freeze-time walk descends into a value-map, so a quotation stored as one of its values is
\ seen. Under the interpreter-free lock a metadata-only image carries empty word bodies, so the
\ module word that quotation calls must be compiled. The build promotes it and the dispatch runs.
\
\ The companion `aot_value_map_module.1z` is the same program built with `--emit-runtime-image`.

use "./support/value_map_state.1z" ;

1 7 run-handler .
